@startuml b-seq-main
title Вариант 2 (Temporal). Основной сценарий: транзакционное уведомление доставлено по push
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

participant "Сервис переводов\n(+ outbox)" as P
queue "Kafka" as K
participant "Workflow\nStarter" as ST
participant "Temporal\nServer" as T
participant "Delivery Workflow\nWorker" as WW
participant "Push Activity\nWorker" as PW
participant "APNs / FCM" as APNS
actor "Приложение\nклиента" as APP
participant "Receipt Collector\n+ Signaler" as RC

== Запуск workflow (дедупликация по WorkflowID) ==
P -> K : ntf.tx.requests (outbox продюсера)
K -> ST : NotificationRequested
ST -> ST : notification_id = UUIDv5(producer, idempotency_key)
ST -> T : StartWorkflow(TxDeliveryWorkflow, id = notification_id,\n  USE_EXISTING / REJECT_DUPLICATE)
T --> ST : started\n(или already started → повтор продюсера, отправки нет)
ST -> K : commit offset

== План каналов ==
T -> WW : workflow task
WW --> T : ScheduleActivity build_plan
T -> WW : activity build_plan
WW -> WW : настройки из Redis, шаблон;\nплан: push (T = 10 с) → SMS (T = 60 с) → email
WW --> T : completed(plan)

== Попытка #1: push ==
T -> WW : workflow task
WW --> T : ScheduleActivity send(attempt #1)\ntask queue = push
T -> PW : activity send(attempt #1)
PW -> APNS : send(apns-collapse-id = notification_id)
APNS --> PW : 200 OK
PW --> T : completed
T -> WW : workflow task
WW --> T : StartTimer(10 с), wait_condition(delivered_by)

== Подтверждение сигналом ==
APNS -> APP : push
APP -> RC : POST /v1/acks {notification_id, attempt_id}
RC -> K : ntf.receipts
K -> RC : Receipt (Signaler)
RC -> T : SignalWorkflow(notification_id,\n  receipt(attempt #1, DELIVERED))
T -> WW : workflow task (signal)
WW -> WW : delivered_by = attempt #1
WW --> T : CancelTimer; ScheduleActivity publish_status
T -> WW : activity publish_status
WW -> K : ntf.status: DELIVERED via push
WW --> T : CompleteWorkflow(DELIVERED via push)
note over T : история workflow видна в Temporal Web UI\n(поддержка, разбор инцидентов)
@enduml
